<title>FINLAND: Finnish Dec wholesale prices rise 0.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Dec wholesale prices rise 0.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index rose 0.3 percent in December on November and it rose 0.9 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>			     Dec 1996    Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth		   +0.3 pct    -0.7 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		     +0.9 pct    +0.7 pct	-0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
